# Trained-policy SCRUB (not part of the verified regression set).
# The canonical bit-exact pair (quad_ppo.npz/.onnx) IS committed on purpose:
# smol (~170 KB total) and required for the run_onnx.py regression gate to
# reproduce out-of-the-box.  Everything else that training produces (drift
# variants, intermediate .npz/.onnx, obs norm stats) must be regenerated.
sim/mujoco/*.npz
sim/mujoco/*.onnx
!sim/mujoco/quad_ppo.npz
!sim/mujoco/quad_ppo.onnx
*.onnx.raw

# Bench-measured data — W15 bring-up telemetry, never committed
sea_center.json
sim/mujoco/sea_center.json

